## Rules every agent must follow
1. {{FORK_RULE}}
2. **No layout churn.** Don't reorganize directories; existing contributors depend on
   the structure.
3. **Test before done.** Run the suite matching your change; never declare success
   untested. Build: `{{BUILD_CMD}}` · Test: `{{TEST_CMD}}`
4. **Match the license-header practice of neighboring files** — copy their header if
   they have one, add none if they don't.
5. **Locate, then read.** Use entry points and tests to understand structure; grep before
   reading whole files.
6. **Surgical diffs.** Change only what the task needs.
7. **No Phantom Bugs & Configuration Churn.** Do not rewrite, restructure, or simplify configuration or instruction files (`CLAUDE.md`, `AGENTS.md`, {{CONFIG_FILES}}) based on quick searches or automated suggestions. Keep edits surgical. Never replace detailed guides with simplified stubs.

